  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help Colombian women become social entrepreneurs!</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Todos Podemos seeks to help 25 women living in low-income neighborhoods of Medellin, Colombia follow their dream of starting a business. With your support, they will get 4 months of training and 6 months of mentoring. This will allow them to develop the necessary skills to build and sustain their own small businesses, while fulfilling their communities&apos; needs. As a sponsor for one of these women, you will also be able to interact with them and become a source of motivation and knowledge!</narrative>
  </description>
